{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19107390","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19107390","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910739001:1":{"text":"母神よ、あなたは海流であり、万物であり、循環そのもの……一つのかけらの名前など覚えていないでしょう。ですが、私は覚えています。","source_cn":"母神，您是洋流，是循环，是万物……您或许不会记得一片碎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95CB7DE0327F7976","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910739002:1":{"text":"彼女の名はエストラ――私の亡き妻です。三日月のような笑顔と、泉のように澄んだ歌声……彼女はあなたが前回目覚めたとき、その身に還りました。それから数百年、今もあなたのどこかにいるはずです！","source_cn":"爱丝特菈——我的亡妻！笑颜如月牙，歌声婉转如清泉，她在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x364BFC1FDEC26CD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910739003:1":{"text":"私は同族を殺め、罪を犯しました。ですが、それでも私は……朽ちた体と罪深き魂で、あなたに乞い願う！","source_cn":"我犯下了过错，我终结了同族的生命，但是我祈求……我用自...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF363048A8CE30B4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910739004:1":{"text":"どうか、愛する妻を、私のもとへ帰してください！","source_cn":"让我的爱，再次回到我身边吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17517DEAA785D852","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910739005:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"